    "transcript.md": "# cdc-anthem\n\n**گوینده ۱**\n\nWhen you have a hole in your neck, don't face the shower end.\n\n**گوینده ۱**\n\nSuction out your tube before you eat.\n\n**گوینده ۲**\n\nCrouch, don't bend over. You don't want to lose the food in your stomach.\n\n**گوینده ۳**\n\nSuction out, it's not mouth to mouth. It's mouth to snow.\n\n**گوینده ۳**\n\nDon't use spray paint.\n\n**گوینده ۳**\n\nBe very careful shaving.\n",
